    <detaileddescription>
<para>Notification channel that logs alert payloads via the ThemisDB logger.</para>
<para>Severity mapping:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1observability_1a8ee1043d756365fbf3e4632ae5371c2fa551b723eafd6a31d444fcb2f5920fbd3" kindref="member">AlertSeverity::INFO</ref> → THEMIS_INFO</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1observability_1a8ee1043d756365fbf3e4632ae5371c2fa059e9861e0400dfbe05c98a841f3f96b" kindref="member">AlertSeverity::WARNING</ref> → THEMIS_WARN</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1observability_1a8ee1043d756365fbf3e4632ae5371c2fabb1ca97ec761fc37101737ba0aa2e7c5" kindref="member">AlertSeverity::ERROR</ref> → THEMIS_ERROR</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1observability_1a8ee1043d756365fbf3e4632ae5371c2fa99cd1c61610c76a57cb8d10d6df6b870" kindref="member">AlertSeverity::CRITICAL</ref> → THEMIS_CRITICAL </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
